QuestGuidance.Register("en",142,{
[4513]="7002F63B\n1\tCollect glowing mushrooms from Dígelon (total: 5)\tGlowing mushrooms can be found in Dígelon. Wulfin asked you to venture within Dígelon and gather several glowing mushrooms.\n2\tTalk to Wulfin\tWulfin is at Harwick. Wulfin will be happy to see the glowing mushrooms you were able to gather from Dígelon.\n",
[4514]="7002F102\n1\tDefeat salamanders and lizards in Dígelon (total: 10)\tThe salamanders and lizards can be found in Dígelon. Wulfin asked you to drive out the lizards and salamanders found within Dígelon.\n2\tTalk to Wulfin\tWulfin can be found in Harwick. Wulfin will be pleased to hear you have driven out many of the lizards and salamanders that were within Dígelon.\n",
[4515]="70059870\n1\tDefeat Dúgar the Black Elk\tDúgar the Black Elk can be found in the southern Wildwood. Linnet has asked you to defeat the Black Elk, Dúgar.\n2\tTalk to Linnet\tLinnet is located in the south-central Wildwood. You should talk to Linnet Redholm.\n",
[4516]="70000047\n1\tTalk to Frideric the Elder at Ost Guruth\tThe ruins of Ost Guruth lie near the Great East Road, where Nain Enidh meets Talath Gaun. Hunulf Munce, convinced you could be of great assistance to his people, has asked you to go to the home of the Eglain, Ost Guruth, and speak with Frideric the Elder.\n",
[4517]="700408A0\n1\tAccept Damkalb's challenge\tDamkalb is in the tavern in Lothgobel. You should speak with Damkalb.\n2\tAccept Damkalb's drinking challenge\tDamkalb has challenged you to drink the strong liquors of the Corsairs, which can be found in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should drink the liquors of the Corsairs in the time allotted.\n3\tSpeak with Jajax\tJajax is in the tavern of Lothgobel. You should speak with Jajax.\n",
[4518]="7002D4EE\n1\tFill the water-bucket\030Ensure the food-trough has grain\030Inspect the horse's bedding\tThe new horse in the Combe stables needs some help settling into his new stall.\n2\tPat the horse to comfort him in his new stall\tThe newly arrived horse in Combe may be found in his new stall. The horse is strange to Combe and is still uneasy in his new environment. Pat the horse to comfort him.\n3\tTalk to the stable-helper\tThe stable-helper is near the stables of Combe.\n",
[4519]="70046C32\n1\tRangers of Ithilien can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien. Maendal has asked you to calm his fellow Rangers in the wake of the Haradrim attacker's ill-fated assault.\t\n2\tTalk to Maendal\tMaendal can be found at Aelin Veren, in central North Ithilien. You have done what you could to calm the Rangers of Ithilien at Aelin Veren and should now speak to Maendal.\n",
